{"id":"n2-016","title":"A。だが B。","romaji":"~daga","jlptLevel":2,"shortExplanation":"Expresses contrasting ideas or statements; 'but', 'however'.","longExplanation":"The A。だが B。grammar point is used to express contrasting ideas or statements. It connects two sentences or phrases with a contrasting meaning. It can be translated as 'but' or 'however' in English.","formation":"Sentence A + だが + Sentence B","examples":[{"jp":"このレストランは値段が高い。だが、味はとてもいい。","romaji":"Kono resutoran wa nedan ga takai. Daga, aji wa totemo ii.","en":"This restaurant is expensive. But, the taste is very good.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"レストラン","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"値段","vocabId":"1600160","reading":"ねだん"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"高い","vocabId":"1283190","reading":"たかい"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null},{"surface":"だが","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"味","vocabId":"1526960","reading":"あじ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"とても","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いい","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[7]},{"jp":"彼は疲れている。だが、仕事を終わらせるまで休まない。","romaji":"Kare wa tsukarete iru. Daga, shigoto o owaraseru made yasumanai.","en":"He is tired. However, he will not rest until he finishes work.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"疲れ","vocabId":"1483730","reading":"つかれ","baseForm":"疲れる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null},{"surface":"だが","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"仕事","vocabId":"1304970","reading":"しごと"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"終わら","vocabId":"1589600","reading":"おわる","baseForm":"終わる"},{"surface":"せる","vocabId":"1234050","reading":"せる"},{"surface":"まで","vocabId":null},{"surface":"休ま","vocabId":"1227560","reading":"やすむ","baseForm":"休む"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":